msgstr "ليس لهذا الخصم أقساط معلقة."

#. module: KSW_deduction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:KSW_deduction.ksw_deduction_view_form
msgid ""
"This employee already has another personal loan in progress. Accepting "
